section: language
synopsis: Allow multiple consecutive contexts in prefix GADT constructor declarations (GHC Proposal `#402 <https://github.com/ghc-proposals/ghc-proposals/blob/master/proposals/0402-gadt-syntax.rst>`_ "Stable GADT constructor syntax")
issues: #27424
mrs: !16819

description: {
  Prefix GADT constructor declarations now accept multiple consecutive contexts,
  equivalent to a single conjoined context. For example::

    data G a where
      MkCurried :: C a => (D a, E a) => G a
      MkConjoined :: (C a, D a, E a) => G a

  Record-style GADT constructor declarations continue to accept at most one context.
}
